# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your Anthropic API key.
# Expo inlines variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ into the client bundle.
#
# SECURITY NOTE: because this is a client-side app, the key ships in the bundle.
# That is acceptable for a single-user personal build (per the PRD's data stance),
# but for anything shared, put a thin proxy in front of the Anthropic API and
# point the app at that instead. See src/coach/client.ts.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
